// PARABLE POOL (DR-0257, Darrell 2026-07-30: "can our parables pool from
// cultures also so it feels more authentic?"): parable settings draw
// deliberately from the world's cultures — the Master's own method (His
// parables lived in His hearers' real world, Matthew 13:34) for a Body drawn
