    // (food, water, power, health), and repentance-as-regeneration vs
    // carried guilt. Answered per DR-0100 tiering: the prudence is affirmed
    // plainly (the Word commanded it first); the apocalyptic date-certainty
    // and fear-fuel are corrected by the Word (Matthew 24:36; 2 Timothy
