    // and the truth frees). Carries the law-tier rule (feedback_lessons_explain...):
    // name the WORLD'S powerful challenge fairly -- "religion is just useful
    // comfort" (Bartlett), the problem of evil / "God set us up," prayer as an
    // empirical vending-machine -- and show WHY Yahweh's answer is better AND
