        'What changes when you truly hold “this is the Lord’s ___, not mine”? Where do you most need that mind right now (Romans 8:6)?',
        'Be honest: where have you carried “divers weights” — a lighter standard for yourself and a harder one for someone else (Proverbs 20:10)? What would the equal weight look like?',
        '“The greatest servant is the king” (cf. Mark 10:43-45). What is one task you’d normally hand off that you could pick up yourself this week?',
        'Is there something you did or said publicly that needs a PUBLIC repair — reconciling and asking forgiveness out loud (Matthew 5:24; James 5:16)? What holds you back, and what would love do?',
