    // Darrell then asked to add it to the living Course as well. This is the single
    // integrated Living Lesson, moving through the sermon's spine: MADE (identity
    // received), THINK (critical thinking, own the why), TESTED not tempted (the
    // "rigged" outcome), BEYOND (God outside our dimension, seen in the Son), and SENT
