      "howToRun": "Open with the Hemhauser line and a show of hands: who feels pressure to be the expert on everything? (5) | Read 1 Corinthians 12:12-21 aloud; name the members and gifts in your own group (8) | Teach the Moses and Jethro account and the wear-away warning (7) | Read one parable aloud and discuss the quiet risk / the bottleneck (10) | Walk the four connector instincts with a real project or ministry example (10) | inApp exercise: each person names one thing they carry alone and three gifts to join (8) | Close in prayer for humility and for the people Yahweh has placed around us (5)",
