        'THE PIVOT — spend the most time here: "rejoice not, that the spirits are subject unto you; but rather rejoice, because your names are written in heaven" (Luke 10:20). Power-joy rises and falls with the mission and curdles into pride; Book-joy is untouchable. Identity outranks authority.',
