        'Land the secret place as INTIMACY, not technique (Psalm 91:1; Matthew 6:6) — and the Kingdom-within, so the fight is personal AND corporate (Luke 17:21; 1 Corinthians 12:27).',
        'End on the promise, not on dread: resist and the enemy FLEES (James 4:7), and it is the LIVING God we serve (Matthew 16:16). Guardrail: discernment must not become an accusing spirit.',
