  // ── L74 — CHURCH HURT, THE COUNTERFEIT COMFORT, AND THE BLOOD ─────────────
  // Captured from a video teaching handed into this house: Karen's testimony
  // (author of "Bloodbought") — church hurt in a home that performed at church
  // and raged behind the door, the turn to the occult and the sex industry,
  // addiction and homelessness, and the deliverance encounter that ended it.
  // A summary rather than the full transcript, so it is attributed at that
  // register (DR-0076 §8).
  //
  // PASTORAL HANDLING (deliberate, and the reason this lesson reads the way it
  // does): the Word does the naming, not the details. Sin is named the way
  // Scripture names it and then LEFT at the blood — no re-telling of the occult
  // practices, no graphic account of the industry, nothing that would titillate
  // or re-wound. 1 Corinthians 6:9-10's list is REFERENCED, and verse 11's turn
  // is what gets quoted, because a list used as a weapon against a woman Christ
  // washed is the same hypocrisy this lesson indicts. The coerced abortion is
