  // solid Scripture with non-canonical material (the Book of Enoch) and with
  // historical claims its own summary concedes are "unverified." So the three
  // tiers (DR-0100) do heavy lifting, and the governing verse is turned on the
  // LESSON ITSELF: Colossians 2:18 warns against "intruding into those things
  // which he hath not seen" — a rebuke aimed precisely at over-speculation about
  // the angelic realm, which is the besetting sin of this entire genre.
  //
  // THE CANON QUESTION IS OPEN AND IS TREATED AS OPEN. docs/00-foundations/_root/
