        'Open by reading the angel descriptions cold, with no commentary: Isaiah 6:2, Ezekiel 1:16-18, Revelation 4:8, Daniel 10:6-8. Then ask why angels so often open with "Fear not" (Luke 2:10) and let the room reach it themselves. Concede plainly that the church softened this.',
