      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): open in prayer; read Matthew 25:31-34 aloud (KJV). | Recap last week (10): blessed and highly favored — who found their chapter? | Teach the big idea (15): the Word as the King’s code; the if-then agreement test in the Word’s own words; sheep vs the world’s GOAT. | Word-walk (20): read together John 10:4-5 + 27; 1 John 2:3-4; Isaiah 1:19-20; Matthew 7:22-23; Jeremiah 31:33 — let the room say what each branch of the if-then means in a real week. | Discussion (10): the prompts below. | Send-off + solo task (5): NOTICE→TEST→CAPTURE→REDIRECT — one decision this week run through "does this agree with what is written?"',
