  // L87 — Darrell's spoken lesson, 2026-08-24 (three utterances, one flow):
  // "What is the difference between Yahweh's Way and works of iniquity and why
  // can't we understand or see the Truth Light or Way and what can we do to
  // See like Jesus says and Yahweh's business is to etc..." · "Wisdom of man
