        'Set the Author above the artifact: the researchers repurposed a molecule Yahweh authored (Psalm 139:14,16; Colossians 1:17) — wonder runs UP. Spoken into the app by the Governor from a forwarded science article; captured same session, every verse verbatim KJV, the article\'s figures carried as reported (DR-0076).',
