        'Actions over words, and judged by deeds: "why call ye me, Lord, Lord, and do not the things which I say?" (Luke 6:46); "faith without works is dead" (James 2:26); "reward every man according to his works" (Matthew 16:27); books opened, judged by works (Revelation 20:12).',
