      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): open in prayer; read John 14:15 and Luke 17:21 aloud (KJV). | The standard (10): love is obedience, a clean if-then — John 14:15,21,23; 1 John 5:3; and why words alone fail (Luke 6:46; James 2:26). | Judged by deeds (10): Matthew 16:27; Romans 2:6; Revelation 20:12 — the deeds are the record. | The hinge (15): the deeds reach the thoughts not cast down (2 Corinthians 10:5; Matthew 5:28; Matthew 15:19) and the study never done (2 Timothy 2:15; James 4:17) — walk NOTICE-TEST-CAPTURE-REDIRECT. | Body, Church, Kingdom, temple (10): 1 Corinthians 12:27; Matthew 16:18; Luke 17:20-21; 1 Corinthians 3:16 — why the Kingdom is within because we are His temple. | The mirror (5): each person names one uncaptured thought and one deferred study, and prays them captive. | Send-off (5): obedience as the proof of love today (1 John 5:3).',
