        'Honor 43 years of faithful service (Matthew 25:21; Ecclesiastes 9:15-16 — the forgotten faithful); demand an honest accounting of a more-than-doubled public cost (Proverbs 11:1; 20:10; Luke 16:2) short of a verdict.',
