        'A just weight for WORDS: verify every claim, including our own (Exodus 23:1; 1 Thessalonians 5:21; Proverbs 18:17). Worked live — the "Congressman vs CFO" claim about Jimmy Patronis: verified against the public record, Patronis has been the U.S. Representative for FL-01 since April 2025 (CFO only through March 2025), so a well-meant correction was itself outdated. Correct ourselves gladly.',
