      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): read Proverbs 11:1 and Acts 10:34 aloud (KJV). | Recap (10): where last week became a DEED. | Teach the arc (15): honor faithful service (Matthew 25:21; Ecclesiastes 9:15-16) -> a just weight with public money (Proverbs 11:1; Luke 16:2) -> no respecter of persons, both tiers (Acts 10:34; 1 Samuel 16:7) -> plead for the one without power (Proverbs 31:8-9) -> a just weight for WORDS, verify every claim incl. our own (Exodus 23:1; 1 Thessalonians 5:21; the Patronis check) -> a just process not vengeance (Proverbs 18:17; Romans 12:19) -> security in the Lord, not a contract (Philippians 4:19). | Do-it-now (20): each person names one CLAIM in a current story they were about to repeat but have not verified, and one faithful worker they could honor or advocate for. | Discussion (15): the prompts below. | Send-off (5): verify one claim this week before you share it.',
