        'The final court: Yahweh judges the judges (Psalms 82:1) and brings every work into judgment (Ecclesiastes 12:14) — comfort to the wronged, warning to every bench. Pairs with L37 (One Blood), L90 (No Respecter of Persons), L97 (A Just Weight).',
