        'WORD FIRST, THEN INDEPENDENTLY RESEARCHED - in that order, and it is the whole method of this lesson. Darrell brought in a circulating clip (2026-09-02) with one instruction, lesson, and one standard: Word first, and all lessons independently researched. So Scripture sets the test (movements 2-3) BEFORE any statistic is examined (movements 4-7). Attribute the clip as the OCCASION, never as the authority; it is named only so the room can be educated past it (DR-0098), and every quoted span is verbatim KJV from the in-repo corpus (DR-0076).',
