        'Concede the language in the first thirty seconds, out loud, before anyone asks. Paul calls himself a servant; the Greek is doulos and it is not soft. A room that hears you concede the true half will believe the rest, and a room that hears you dodge it will not.',
        'Make the distinction precisely: the objection is not wrong that the word is there. It is wrong that the word means what the Atlantic trade meant. That is a definition error, not a moral one, and treating it as a definition error keeps the conversation survivable.',
