        'Have somebody read the eleven Gospel scenes ALOUD from their own Bible rather than from the screen. People believe a list they found in their own copy in a way they never believe a list somebody handed them.',
        'End by naming who got there first: a leper, a ruler, a mother, a man from the tombs, a man born blind. Not scholars. Desperate people who needed Him and were right.',
