      'Dwell with them according to knowledge. Name one thing your spouse’s body is doing in this season that you have never actually asked about. Will you ask this week?',
      'Where have you used the body as an EXCUSE (a diagnosis handed over instead of repentance), and where have you used it as an ACCUSATION (calling exhaustion rebellion)? Both are named. Which is yours?',
